r Bobby\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1viFwXluAettogGDsTrSUUg29lZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9BrhCgffilZPr3VOnDAKP9vBrU1.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Bobby Griffith was his mother's favorite son, the perfect all-American boy growing up under deeply religious influences in Walnut Creek, California. Bobby was also gay. Struggling with a conflict no one knew of, much less understood, Bobby finally came out to his family.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":288119,\"title\":\"Birthday Cake\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zbIqCVZRv2G6bb45v5Xfw434lWM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kDDvJhlHFWRpVnkdPO2SlGevwdi.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Soap actor Steven and his husband Daniel decide to throw the ultimate first birthday party for their daughter. What Daniel doesn’t know is that Steven has invited Daniel’s estranged religious mother and sister to the party. Now, Daniel sees the festivities beginning to spiral out of control. There’s now a dead clown, a demanding diva, a cake that unfortunately looks like a lifeless baby, and a manhunt in the neighborhood for a murderer!\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22597,\"title\":\"The Broken Hearts Club: A Romantic Comedy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g9bqbopRZYy5Z2137zFoFQRXVEW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bu8Ixqtg7vx1L0UlnV5sekYXizU.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A close-knit group of gay friends share the emotional roller coster of life, relationships, the death of friends, new beginnings, jealousy, fatherhood and professional success. At various stages of life's disarray, these young men share humorous and tragic relationships and always have each other to rely on.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],